<title>INDIA: India Tata Investment 1996/97 net higher.</title>
<headline>India Tata Investment 1996/97 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     198.17     vs     178.53</p>
<p>    Income		   318.50     vs     279.14</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	  4.50     vs	 3.5</p>
<p>    Expenditure	     38.14     vs	17.47</p>
<p>    Interest		  34.97     vs	25.03</p>
<p>    Depreciation	     2.05     vs	 2.39</p>
<p>    Tax			 45.17     vs	55.72</p>
<p>Note: Tata Investment Corporation is a part of the Tata group, India's largest industrial house.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
